WEBVTT

00:16:59.967 --> 00:17:01.696
or many of the others that we had;

00:17:01.720 --> 00:17:05.459
there were some outstanding players.

00:17:06.617 --> 00:17:08.682
Have I rambled enough?

00:17:08.706 --> 00:17:12.833
I was told that when he makes
his appearance, I was supposed to shut up.

00:17:12.857 --> 00:17:14.127
(Laughter)

00:17:14.151 --> 00:17:18.000
(Applause)